etting hotter  could it happen again  of course it was happened once so yeah  yeah definitely  fire officials have told us that some of  the people whose homes have been  destroyed in this village are actually  still on holiday and so haven't yet seen  what remains of their homes while others  of course don't forget will have fled  here on tuesday as the flames approached  with nothing but the clothes on their  back so really do have nothing left all  they have is is the rubble where their  home once stood  even though it's now five days since the  fire we've only just been allowed access  to the village because of the threat  of reignition and fight so firefighters  have spent the last five days damping  down the embers and the ashes to ensure  there are no lingering hot spots and  even though the area is now considered  safe for the public to return it's clear  this village has changed forever
 

